From: "live-speech-filter (local)" <local@live-speech-filter.invalid>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:33:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?censor-engine:=20a=20match=20at=20the=20very=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?end=20of=20the=20recognized=20text=20whose=20rule=20looks=20at?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20the=20next=20character=20("(=3F!",=20e.g.=20=E6=93=8D=20but?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20not=20=E6=93=8D=E4=BD=9C)=20waits=20until=20the=20next=20cha?=
 =?UTF-8?q?racter=20is=20there,=20the=20segment=20ends,=20or=200.4=20s=20o?=
 =?UTF-8?q?f=20audio=20after=20the=20match=20was=20first=20seen,=20instead?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20of=20muting=20"=E8=BF=99=E6=B3=A2=E6=93=8D"=20before=20"?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E4=BD=9C"=20arrives;=20rules=20starting=20"(=3F:^|...)"=20that?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20consume=20the=20character=20before=20the=20word=20are=20time?=
 =?UTF-8?q?d=20and=20keyed=20on=20the=20word=20only=20(the=20consumed=20ch?=
 =?UTF-8?q?aracter=20is=20no=20longer=20muted=20or=20reported=20late);=20w?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ord=20list=20items=20starting=20with=20"!"=20are=20allowed=20ph?=
 =?UTF-8?q?rases=20(none=20built=20in,=20a=20user=20can=20add=20one=20to?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20the=20custom=20words):=20a=20regex=20or=20pinyin=20match=20i?=
 =?UTF-8?q?nside=20one=20in=20the=20text=20is=20ignored,=20and=20a=20match?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20that=20could=20still=20become=20one=20waits=20like=20a=20rig?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ht-context=20match;=20rules=20are=20parsed=20once=20per=20word?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20list=20change;=20with=20debug=20logging=20each=20mute=20logs?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20the=20lane=20and=20its=20text?=
